  "content": "<h1>工具提示風格化</h1>\n<p><strong>此資源包為物品工具提示添加了徽章/圖標和顏色。</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgabriel-djalayer.gitbook.io%252fgdteam-wiki%252fprojects%252fressource-packs%252ftooltips-stylized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-WIKI-2c2c2c?style=for-the-badge&logo=gitbook&logoColor=white\" alt=\"IMG Badge - Wiki\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tooltips-stylized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ON-CURSEFORGE-_?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&labelColor=2c2c2c&color=e58e0e&logoColor=e58e0e\" alt=\"IMG Badge - Download on Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ftooltips-stylized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ON-MODRINTH-_?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&labelColor=2c2c2c&color=17b95a&logoColor=17b95a\" alt=\"IMG Badge - Download on Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgabrieldja\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-SUPPORT-6d30fd?style=for-the-badge&logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"IMG Badge - Support\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgabrieldjalayer.wixsite.com%252fgabrieldja-gaming-yt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/MY_WEBSITE-245cf3?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"IMG Badge - GD Team\"></a></p>\n<h3>📜 許可證</h3>\n<p>此資源包由 <strong>GabrielDja</strong> 創建。<br>\n📑 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgabriel-djalayer.gitbook.io%252fgdteam-wiki%252fguides%252flicenses%2523tooltips-stylized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">閱讀使用條款</a></strong></p>\n<h3>ℹ️ 不需要 Optifine</h3>\n<h4>提供以下語言：</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>英文（美國）</li>\n<li>法文（法國）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🔥 功能特點</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>物品圖標</li>\n<li>徽章圖標</li>\n<li>附加信息，包括營養、光照等級等…</li>\n<li>工具提示背景紋理（適用於 1.21.2+ 版本）</li>\n<li>此資源包已針對比例 2 界面設置進行了調整（未來可能支持比例 1 和 3）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>⭐ 最佳體驗</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fgui-simplestylized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/31958c_923720d30a924f2bb797da965271b01c~mv2.png\" alt=\"Best Experience with this Pack!\"></a></p>\n<h2>指南 / 預覽</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/mC2IML84/images/3f46f9251afd53c389f3f2beff86cb25462308c3.gif\" alt=\"PreviewGIF\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/31958c_ef06494637f14cfabe66d6b697c1b0ae~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"Preview\"></p>\n<h2>✨ 合作夥伴</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.rocketnode.com%252fgabrieldja\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/31958c_568565d2774047e188ebd98b83ef588c~mv2.png\" alt=\"Partnership RocketNode Banner - GabrielDja\"></a></p>",
